# Breathwise needs no client-side environment variables.
#
# Air-quality, weather and geocoding APIs are keyless, and the Gemini key lives
# server-side (Cloudflare secret / .dev.vars — see .dev.vars.example).
#
# WARNING: anything prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into public JavaScript.
# Never put an API key or other secret in a VITE_* variable.
